=== PARITY ===
Reads / queries (3/3 ported):
  [x] useWebhookChannels
        store    : NotificationChannelsStore.webhookChannels()
                   : StateFlow<Resource<List<NotificationChannel.Webhook>>>
        endpoint : GET /notifications  (web useNotificationChannels list; transport adds /api/v1)
        cache    : CacheDomain.Notifications, key="channels"  (web notificationKeys.channels)
        derived  : filterWebhookChannels() = list.filterIsInstance<Webhook>() (web
                   `kind === 'webhook'`, order-preserving) applied to EVERY Resource emission
                   (cached / loading / fresh) — data is always a (possibly empty) list.
        emit     : cache -> network (Resource.Loading[cached] -> Resource.Success/Error), one
                   shared feed (SharingStarted.WhileSubscribed) across observers.
        SI       : channel config fields are non-unit strings/bools — round-trip verbatim,
                   no conversion (S5 N/A).
  [x] useWebhookSignaturePreview
        store    : NotificationChannelsStore.previewWebhookSignature(secret, body)
                   : Result<WebhookSignaturePreviewResult>
        endpoint : POST /notifications/webhooks/preview-signature
        body     : { secret, body } — both fields ALWAYS serialize (web JSON.stringify(body)),
                   empty body string included.
        invalidates: NOTHING (web mutation has no onSuccess invalidate). Pure utility.
  [x] useInvalidateWebhookChannels
        store    : NotificationChannelsStore.invalidateWebhookChannels()
        action   : bumps the channel-feed trigger -> re-collects cache->network (web
                   invalidateQueries notificationKeys.channels). No-op when feed is unobserved.
Mutations / actions (1/1 ported):
  [x] useTestWebhookChannel
        store    : NotificationChannelsStore.testWebhookChannel(id, title?, message?)
                   : Result<WebhookTestResult>
        endpoint : POST /notifications/{id}/webhook-test
        body     : webhookTestBody(title, message) — a key included ONLY when value != null AND
                   trim() != '' (web guard); the VERBATIM untrimmed value is sent; an all-blank
                   pair => NO body (server defaults). Mirrors the web mutationFn attaching a
                   body/Content-Type only when at least one field is present.
        contract : the endpoint answers HTTP 200 in every delivery outcome, so a non-2xx
                   RECEIVER decodes to a success Result with `success == false`
                   (status_code/error populated), NOT a request failure; a real 5xx from the
                   API endpoint itself IS a Result failure.
        invalidates: NOTHING (web mutation renders the result inline; no onSuccess invalidate).

Web-parity notes (NOT silent drift)
  - useNotificationChannels / useSaveChannel / useDeleteChannel / useToggleChannel /
    useTestChannel are RE-EXPORTS from the useNotifications domain (separate hook file/domain,
    ported by S8-0032) — out of scope for this slice, which ports only the 4 webhook-specific
    hooks the file ADDS.
  - useMutationToast / notificationKeys / type re-exports are render-layer / cross-domain
    plumbing, not data behaviour; reproduced as the holder's invalidate semantics, not as
    separate APIs.

